```mermaid
graph TB
    Start([📧 New Email Arrives]) --> Gmail[Gmail Inbox]
    
    Gmail --> Watcher[🔍 Gmail Watcher<br/>Python Script<br/>Checks every 2 min]
    
    Watcher --> Filter{Email Match?<br/>unread + important}
    
    Filter -->|No| Wait[⏳ Keep Watching]
    Wait --> Watcher
    
    Filter -->|Yes| Create[📝 Create .md File<br/>in /Needs_Action]
    
    Create --> Vault[(🗂️ Obsidian Vault<br/>/Needs_Action)]
    
    Vault --> Orchestrator[⚙️ Orchestrator<br/>Monitors folders<br/>every 60 sec]
    
    Orchestrator --> Detect{New Files?}
    
    Detect -->|No| Monitor[👀 Keep Monitoring]
    Monitor --> Orchestrator
    
    Detect -->|Yes| Trigger[🚀 Trigger Claude Code]
    
    Trigger --> Claude[🤖 Claude Code<br/>+ Agent Skill]
    
    Claude --> Read[📖 Read Email<br/>Extract Details]
    Read --> Assess[🎯 Assess Priority<br/>High/Medium/Low]
    Assess --> Draft[✍️ Draft Response<br/>if needed]
    Draft --> Update[📊 Update Dashboard.md]
    Update --> Move[📁 Move to /Done]
    
    Move --> Done[(✅ /Done Folder<br/>Archived)]
    
    Done --> Complete([✨ Task Complete!])
    
    style Start fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff
    style Gmail fill:#EA4335,color:#fff
    style Watcher fill:#2196F3,color:#fff
    style Vault fill:#9C27B0,color:#fff
    style Orchestrator fill:#FF9800,color:#fff
    style Claude fill:#00BCD4,color:#fff
    style Done fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff
    style Complete fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff
```
